  <p class="text-block">
    Grouping controls into speed categories reveals clear patterns in how time affects game characteristics:
  </p>

  <table class="stats-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Category</th><th>Games</th><th>White Win %</th><th>Draw Rate</th><th>Avg Turns</th><th>Timeout Rate</th><th>Mate Rate</th><th>Resign Rate</th></tr>
